
Welcome to Cameo — any AMD card -> a working LLM box.

  After login, cameo-hello prints the console URL and key.
  Open that URL from a phone or laptop on this LAN.
  Press “Start qwen2.5-0.5b and chat”. That starter is a smoke test;
  pull a larger model when you have a network.

  cameo gpu-status              GPU tier (1/2/3)
  cameo-hello                   console URL + key again
  cameo pull --list             extra models (needs network)
  cameo --help                  everything else

  Wi-Fi (no Ethernet):
    iwctl
      station list
      station wlan0 scan
      station wlan0 get-networks
      station wlan0 connect 'YourSSID'

Still on the USB live session? Install to disk (offline, copies the image):
  cameo-install-guided   the installer — account, disk, confirm
  cameo-install          dry run — shows the plan, changes nothing
  After install: reboot first; unplug the USB only when the screen goes dark.
  Live-USB console keys last until reboot.

Docs & source: https://github.com/sadlowskik/Cameo
